Join us Sunday November 23rd as Packer, Grind & HOKA host RUNSGIVING — a 5k run from Packer to Grind Coffee Shop where all proceeds go towards providing Turkeys for those in need this Thanksgiving, courtesy of Angela Cares. 

We’ll have demos and giveaways provided by our friends at HOKA. 

Bag drop/meet up at 10:30am
Run starts at 11am!

