Peace & Power ✊🏾
To everyone who donated, volunteered, shared, or simply showed up — thank you.
Because of you, families affected by the shutdown received food, support, and love when they needed it most.
This is what community looks like.
This is what power looks like.

💛 We did this together — and we’re doing it again November 30th!
Mark your calendars and keep the energy flowing.

